received.body:
You applied for the role “{role}” in the Zrzur Team. People from the team read every application; an answer can take a while.

{terms}

We stored your answers, your account and the role. Only the owner and the review team see them. You can withdraw at any time in {channel}: press “My application”. Your answers are then erased at once. More: {privacy}

received_volunteers.body:
You applied for the role “{role}” in the Zrzur Team. People from the team read every application; an answer can take a while.

{terms}

We stored your answers, your account, the role, and the name, age and country you gave in “About you”. Only the owner and the review team see your answers; your name, age and country are seen only by the owner and by reviewers who accepted the volunteer rules, through “Show identity”. You can withdraw at any time in {channel}: press “My application”. Your answers and “About you” are then erased at once. More: {privacy}

