rejected.body:
Thank you for applying for “{role}” and for the time you took. We are not taking your application further this time.
{reason}

This says nothing about you as a member of Zrzur. You are welcome to apply again after {days} days.

volunteer.identity_request.body:
Thank you for being a volunteer as “{role}”. We would like a few details from you: your name, age and country, and that you accept the volunteer rules. They let the owner know who holds team powers in Zrzur and help keep the team safe. Giving them is voluntary: if you prefer not to, nothing changes for you.

Only the owner, and reviewers who accepted the volunteer rules, can see them, and every look is logged. They are kept while you are on the team and deleted after you leave; days kept after leaving: {keep}. More: {privacy}

When you have time, press “My team status” in the apply channel, then “Add my details”.

volunteer.removed.body:
Your volunteer role “{role}” in the Zrzur Team has ended. Thank you for the time you gave.
{reason}

You are welcome to apply again later.
